PUT /api/{vpn,dns,logs,stats,telegram}/config	admin	\fIX\fR config set
POST /api/vpn/config/preview	admin	vpn config preview
POST /api/vpn/{start,stop,restart,reconnect}	admin	vpn \fIop\fR
POST /api/dns/{start,stop,restart}	admin	dns \fIop\fR
